### Parking Slot Management Tests
### Make sure to authenticate first using the auth endpoints to get access tokens
### Replace {{accessToken}} with a valid JWT access token from authentication

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjEsImVtYWlsIjoidGVzdEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJjdXN0b21lciIsImlhdCI6MTc2MDEyNjk4NSwiZXhwIjoxNzYwMTMwNTg1fQ.t4d8SVONI2cR4MBqAwK4QNh7xDkGgjhYnfHVuEpO3Ck

### 1. Create a Four-Wheeler Public Parking Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "floorId": 1,
  "slotNumber": "A-001",
  "slotType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC",
  "isOccupied": false,
  "isMaintenance": false
}

### 2. Create a Two-Wheeler Reserved Parking Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "floorId": 1,
  "slotNumber": "B-001",
  "slotType": "TWO_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "RESERVED",
  "isOccupied": false,
  "isMaintenance": false
}

### 3. Create Parking Slot with Minimal Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotNumber": "C-001",
  "slotType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC"
}

### 4. Create Multiple Parking Slots for Floor 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "floorId": 1,
  "slotNumber": "A-002",
  "slotType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC"
}

### 5. Create Parking Slot for Floor 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "floorId": 2,
  "slotNumber": "A-001",
  "slotType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC"
}

### 6. Get All Parking Slots (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Get Parking Slots by Floor
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?floorId=1&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Get Four-Wheeler Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotType=FOUR_WHEELER&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get Two-Wheeler Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotType=TWO_WHEELER&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Get Reserved Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?reservationType=RESERVED&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Get Public Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?reservationType=PUBLIC&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Get Occupied Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?isOccupied=true&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Get Available Slots Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?isOccupied=false&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Get Slots Under Maintenance
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?isMaintenance=true&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Search Slots by Slot Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotNumber=A-001&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Get Available Parking Slots (All Types)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/available
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17. Get Available Four-Wheeler Slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/available?slotType=FOUR_WHEELER
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Get Available Two-Wheeler Slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/available?slotType=TWO_WHEELER
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. Get Available Slots on Floor 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/available?floorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. Get Available Four-Wheeler Slots on Floor 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/available?slotType=FOUR_WHEELER&floorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 21. Get Parking Slot by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 22. Get Parking Slot by Floor and Slot Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/floor/1/slot/A-001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 23. Get Parking Slot Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 24. Get Floor Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/floor/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 25. Update Parking Slot Information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotType": "TWO_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "RESERVED"
}

### 26. Update Slot Status (Mark as Occupied)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isOccupied": true,
  "isMaintenance": false
}

### 27. Update Slot Status (Mark as Under Maintenance)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/2/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isOccupied": false,
  "isMaintenance": true
}

### 28. Update Slot Status (Mark as Available)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isOccupied": false,
  "isMaintenance": false
}

### 29. Delete Parking Slot
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 30. Test Invalid Slot Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotNumber": "INV-001",
  "slotType": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC"
}

### 31. Test Invalid Reservation Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotNumber": "INV-002",
  "slotType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "INVALID_TYPE"
}

### 32. Test Duplicate Slot Number on Same Floor
POST {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "floorId": 1,
  "slotNumber": "A-001",
  "slotType": "TWO_WHEELER",
  "reservationType": "PUBLIC"
}

### 33. Test Invalid Status Combination (Occupied + Maintenance)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isOccupied": true,
  "isMaintenance": true
}

### 34. Test Get Non-existent Parking Slot
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 35. Test Update Non-existent Parking Slot
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotType": "TWO_WHEELER"
}

### 36. Test Delete Non-existent Parking Slot
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 37. Test Access Without Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots

### 38. Test Access with Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### 39. Test Large Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 40. Test Negative Page Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?page=-1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 41. Test Zero Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?page=1&limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 42. Test Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?floorId=1&slotType=FOUR_WHEELER&isOccupied=false&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 43. Test Empty Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotNumber=&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 44. Test Special Characters in Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotNumber=A%2D001&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 45. Test Case Sensitivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?slotNumber=a-001&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 46. Test Boolean Filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?isOccupied=false&isMaintenance=false&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 47. Test Floor Statistics for Non-existent Floor
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/floor/999/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 48. Test Find by Non-existent Floor and Slot
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/floor/999/slot/NON-EXISTENT
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 49. Test Complex Filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots?floorId=1&slotType=FOUR_WHEELER&reservationType=PUBLIC&isOccupied=false&isMaintenance=false&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 50. Test Update with Duplicate Slot Number
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/parking-slots/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "slotNumber": "A-002"
}

